<view class="page">
  <view class="hero surface">
    <view class="hero-rule"></view>
    <view class="hero-meta">
      <text class="hero-eyebrow">离职权益工具</text>
      <text class="hero-badge">移动端</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-title">{{product.name}}</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">
      填写在职时间、工资和解除情形，生成金额区间、计算拆解、法律依据和行动清单。
    </view>
    <view class="flow-strip">
      <view class="flow-item"><text class="flow-index">01</text>日期</view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text class="flow-index">02</text>工资</view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text class="flow-index">03</text>情形</view>
      <view class="flow-item"><text class="flow-index">04</text>报告</view>
    </view>
    <button
      class="primary-button hero-button"
      hover-class="primary-button-pressed"
      bindtap="start"
    >
      开始估算
    </button>
    <view class="price-note">{{product.priceNote}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-label">报告包含</view>
  <view class="feature-list surface">
    <view wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="title" class="feature-item">
      <view class="feature-index">0{{index + 1}}</view>
      <view class="feature-content">
        <view class="feature-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="feature-copy">{{item.description}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    报告用于第一轮估算，不构成正式法律意见。地区数据和法律条款需要在上线前复核。
  </view>
</view>

<disclaimer-bar />
